cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SensorFault-Bench or its fault operators, for example to
  pretrain or augment models, please cite the paper given under
  preferred-citation. Work that uses the fault operators adapted from
  the sensor failure modes of Brandt et al. (2025) should also cite the
  paper listed under references.
type: software
title: "SensorFault-Bench"
abstract: >-
  SensorFault-Bench evaluates forecasting architectures and
  robustness-improvement methods for cyber-physical systems under controlled
  sensor faults on real input histories. It reports worst-scenario
  degradation, clean mean squared error, and worst-scenario fault-time mean
  squared error.
